<h3 data-start="1243" data-end="1278" class=""><strong data-start="1247" data-end="1278">2. Source of Representation</strong></h3>
<div class="_tableContainer_16hzy_1"><div tabindex="-1" class="_tableWrapper_16hzy_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse"><table data-start="1280" data-end="1892" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="1280" data-end="1313"><tr data-start="1280" data-end="1313"><th data-start="1280" data-end="1289" data-col-size="sm">Aspect</th><th data-start="1289" data-end="1299" data-col-size="lg"><strong data-start="1291" data-end="1298">FER</strong></th><th data-start="1299" data-end="1313" data-col-size="lg"><strong data-start="1301" data-end="1311">TARTAN</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="1348" data-end="1892"><tr data-start="1348" data-end="1601"><td data-start="1348" data-end="1373" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="1350" data-end="1372">Learning Mechanism</strong></td><td data-start="1373" data-end="1463" data-col-size="lg">Representations emerge from optimization (typically SGD) and are judged via performance</td><td data-start="1463" data-end="1601" data-col-size="lg">Representations are constructed <em data-start="1497" data-end="1507">a priori</em> through recursive spatial-temporal tiling and semantic embedding, then trained generatively</td></tr><tr data-start="1602" data-end="1892"><td data-start="1602" data-end="1632" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="1604" data-end="1631">Assumption on Emergence</strong></td><td data-start="1632" data-end="1758" data-col-size="lg">Skeptical: scaling alone may not yield good representations; optimization may lead to redundancy and brittle generalization</td><td data-start="1758" data-end="1892" data-col-size="lg">Assumes learned representations must be scaffolded with physical and semantic priors to ensure generalization and interpretability</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sticky end-(--thread-content-margin) h-0 self-end select-none"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end" style="height: 32.7031px;"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="bg-token-bg-primary hover:bg-t