<h3 data-start="1899" data-end="1933" class=""><strong data-start="1903" data-end="1933">3. Structural Organization</strong></h3>
<div class="_tableContainer_16hzy_1"><div tabindex="-1" class="_tableWrapper_16hzy_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse"><table data-start="1935" data-end="2710" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="1935" data-end="1968"><tr data-start="1935" data-end="1968"><th data-start="1935" data-end="1944" data-col-size="sm">Aspect</th><th data-start="1944" data-end="1954" data-col-size="md"><strong data-start="1946" data-end="1953">FER</strong></th><th data-start="1954" data-end="1968" data-col-size="lg"><strong data-start="1956" data-end="1966">TARTAN</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="2003" data-end="2710"><tr data-start="2003" data-end="2243"><td data-start="2003" data-end="2030" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="2005" data-end="2029">Entanglement Concern</strong></td><td data-start="2030" data-end="2129" data-col-size="md">Interactions between unrelated functions corrupt each other due to shared, ill-defined subspaces</td><td data-start="2129" data-end="2243" data-col-size="lg">Directly mitigated via <strong data-start="2154" data-end="2178">Gaussian aura fields</strong> that spatially separate and encode agent dynamics and metadata</td></tr><tr data-start="2244" data-end="2496"><td data-start="2244" data-end="2269" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="2246" data-end="2268">Redundancy Problem</strong></td><td data-start="2269" data-end="2356" data-col-size="md">Repeated implementations of the same concept across different regions of the network</td><td data-start="2356" data-end="2496" data-col-size="lg">Avoided through recursive decomposition and explicit reuse of field-based dynamic primitives (e.g., reusable trajectories or aura types)</td></tr><tr data-start="2497" data-end="2710"><td data-start="2497" data-end="2528" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="2499" data-end="2527">Localization of Function</strong></td><td data-start="2528" data-end="2604" data-col-size="md">No guarantee; same concept can be distributed across disconnected regions</td><td data-start="2604" data-end="2710" data-col-size="lg">Spatially localized and symbolically indexed‚Äîe.g., each actor or object owns its aura and metadata map</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sticky end-(--thread-content-margin) h-0 self-end select-none"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end" style="height: 32.7031px;"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="bg-token-bg-primary hover:bg-token-bg-tertiary text-token-text-secondary my-1 rounded-sm p-1 transition-opacity group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:pointer-events-none group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:opacity-0"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-md-heavy"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7 5C7 3.34315 8.34315 2 10 2H19C20.6569 2 22 3.34315 22 5V14C22 15.6569 20.6569 17 19 17H17V19C17 20.6569 15.6569 22 14 22H5C3.34315 22 2 20.6569 2 19V10C2 8.34315 3.34315 7 5 7H7V5ZM9 7H14C15.6569 7 17 8.34315 17 10V15H19C19.5523 15 20 14.5523 20 14V5C20 4.44772 19.5523 4 19 4H10C9.44772 4 9 4.44772 9 5V7ZM5 9C4.44772 9 4 9.44772 4 10V19C4 19.5523 4.44772 20 5 20H14C14.5523 20 15 19.5523 15 19V10C15 9.44772 14.5523 9 14 9H5Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></button></span></div></div></div></div>
