<h3 data-start="2717" data-end="2756" class=""><strong data-start="2721" data-end="2756">4. Interpretability and Control</strong></h3>
<div class="_tableContainer_16hzy_1"><div tabindex="-1" class="_tableWrapper_16hzy_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse"><table data-start="2758" data-end="3336" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="2758" data-end="2791"><tr data-start="2758" data-end="2791"><th data-start="2758" data-end="2767" data-col-size="sm">Aspect</th><th data-start="2767" data-end="2777" data-col-size="lg"><strong data-start="2769" data-end="2776">FER</strong></th><th data-start="2777" data-end="2791" data-col-size="lg"><strong data-start="2779" data-end="2789">TARTAN</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="2826" data-end="3336"><tr data-start="2826" data-end="3055"><td data-start="2826" data-end="2858" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="2828" data-end="2857">Interpretability Strategy</strong></td><td data-start="2858" data-end="2937" data-col-size="lg">Post hoc analysis (e.g., neuron activation tracing, attention visualization)</td><td data-start="2937" data-end="3055" data-col-size="lg"><em data-start="2939" data-end="2948">Pre hoc</em> encoding‚Äîsemantics and dynamics are embedded from the start (e.g., temperature, intent, velocity fields)</td></tr><tr data-start="3056" data-end="3336"><td data-start="3056" data-end="3083" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="3058" data-end="3082">Modularity &amp; Control</strong></td><td data-start="3083" data-end="3203" data-col-size="lg">A challenge: modularity must be imposed via auxiliary training regimes (e.g., modular networks, sparsity constraints)</td><td data-start="3203" data-end="3336" data-col-size="lg">Intrinsic to system: tiling and aura regions provide clear boundaries and roles; trajectories and meanings are explicitly labeled</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sticky end-(--thread-content-margin) h-0 self-end select-none"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end" style="height: 32.7031px;"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="bg-token-bg-primary hover:bg-token-bg-tertiary text-token-