<h3 data-start="3343" data-end="3404" class=""><strong data-start="3347" data-end="3404">5. Generalization, Creativity, and Continual Learning</strong></h3>
<div class="_tableContainer_16hzy_1"><div tabindex="-1" class="_tableWrapper_16hzy_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse"><table data-start="3406" data-end="4142" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="3406" data-end="3453"><tr data-start="3406" data-end="3453"><th data-start="3406" data-end="3419" data-col-size="sm">Capability</th><th data-start="3419" data-end="3434" data-col-size="md"><strong data-start="3421" data-end="3433">FER View</strong></th><th data-start="3434" data-end="3453" data-col-size="lg"><strong data-start="3436" data-end="3451">TARTAN View</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="3502" data-end="4142"><tr data-start="3502" data-end="3731"><td data-start="3502" data-end="3523" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="3504" data-end="3522">Generalization</strong></td><td data-start="3523" data-end="3619" data-col-size="md">Compromised in sparse or novel regimes due to fractured reuse and unpredictable entanglements</td><td data-start="3619" data-end="3731" data-col-size="lg">Strengthened via physics-consistent extrapolation and reuse of symbolic dynamics across scales and scenarios</td></tr><tr data-start="3732" data-end="3946"><td data-start="3732" data-end="3749" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="3734" data-end="3748">Creativity</strong></td><td data-start="3749" data-end="3838" data-col-size="md">Limited due to representational clutter‚Äîdifficult to cleanly recombine fractured ideas</td><td data-start="3838" data-end="3946" data-col-size="lg">Enabled via modular recombination of aura primitives and trajectories (e.g., dynamic narrative blending)</td></tr><tr data-start="3947" data-end="4142"><td data-start="3947" data-end="3972" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="3949" data-end="3971">Continual Learning</strong></td><td data-start="3972" data-end="4027" data-col-size="md">Prone to interference from entangled representations</td><td data-start="4027" data-end="4142" data-col-size="lg">Encourages non-interfering updates: each actor/region maintains separated, factored aura and trajectory buffers</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sticky end-(--thread-content-margin) h-0 self-end select-none"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end" style="height: 32.7031px;"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="bg-token-bg-primary hover:bg-token-bg-tertiary text-token-text-secondary my-1 rounded-sm p-1 transition-opacity group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:pointer-events-none group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:opacity-0"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-md-heavy"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7 5C7 3.34315 8.34315 2 10 2H19C20.6569 2 22 3.34315 22 5V14C22 15.6569 20.6569 17 19 17H17V19C17 20.6569 15.6569 22 14 22H5C3.34315 22 2 20.6569 2 19V10C2 8.34315 3.34315 7 5 7H7V5ZM9 7H14C15.6569 7 17 8.34315 17 10V15H19C19.5523 15 20 14.5523 20 14V5C20 4.44772 19.5523 4 19 4H10C9.44772 4 9 4.44772 9 5V7ZM5 9C4.44772 9 4 9.44772 4 10V19C4 19.5523 4.44772 20 5 20H14C14.5523 20 15 19.5523 15 19V10C15 9.44772 14.5523 9 14 9H5Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></button></span></div></div></div></div>
