<hr data-start="329" data-end="332" class="">
<h2 data-start="334" data-end="375" class=""><strong data-start="337" data-end="375">TARTAN Framework: Modular Overview</strong></h2>
<hr data-start="377" data-end="380" class="">
<h3 data-start="382" data-end="416" class=""><strong data-start="386" data-end="416">1. Recursive Tiling Engine</strong></h3>
<ul data-start="417" data-end="744">
<li data-start="417" data-end="506" class="">
<p data-start="419" data-end="506" class=""><strong data-start="419" data-end="431">Function</strong>: Decomposes scenes into hierarchical spatial tiles across multiple scales.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="507" data-end="703" class="">
<p data-start="509" data-end="527" class=""><strong data-start="509" data-end="526">Subcomponents</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start="530" data-end="703">
<li data-start="530" data-end="602" class="">
<p data-start="532" data-end="602" class=""><em data-start="532" data-end="556">Tile Hierarchy Manager</em>: Manages parent-child relationships of tiles.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="605" data-end="703" class="">
<p data-start="607" data-end="703" class=""><em data-start="607" data-end="630">Resolution Controller</em>: Dynamically adjusts granularity based on activity or semantic salience.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="704" data-end="744" class="">
<p data-start="706" data-end="744" class=""><strong data-start="706" data-end="716">Output</strong>: Multi-resolution tile map.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="746" data-end="749" class="">
<h3 data-start="751" data-end="791" class=""><strong data-start="755" data-end="791">2. Gaussian Aura Field Generator</strong></h3>
<ul data-start="792" data-end="1203">
<li data-start="792" data-end="925" class="">
<p data-start="794" data-end="925" class=""><strong data-start="794" data-end="806">Function</strong>: Encodes physical and semantic metadata (velocity, temperature, intent, material properties) around agents or objects.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="926" data-end="1133" class="">
<p data-start="928" data-end="946" class=""><strong data-start="928" data-end="945">Subcomponents</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start="949" data-end="1133">
<li data-start="949" data-end="1051" class="">
<p data-start="951" data-end="1051" class=""><em data-start="951" data-end="971">Emitter Assignment</em>: Assigns Gaussian fields to semantic centers (e.g., body joints, heat sources).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1054" data-end="1133" class="">
<p data-start="1056" data-end="1133" class=""><em data-start="1056" data-end="1075">Field Composition</em>: Merges overlapping fields, maintaining interpretability.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="1134" data-end="1203" class="">
<p data-start="1136" data-end="1203" class=""><strong data-start="1136" data-end="1146">Output</strong>: Continuous aura field layers aligned to the tiled grid.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1205" data-end="1208" class="">
<h3 data-start="1210" data-end="1245" class=""><strong data-start="1214" data-end="1245">3. Pixel-Stretching Encoder</strong></h3>
<ul data-start="1246" data-end="1584">
<li data-start="1246" data-end="1340" class="">
<p data-start="1248" data-end="1340" class=""><strong data-start="1248" data-end="1260">Function</strong>: Transforms dynamic temporal data (e.g., motion vectors) into spatial patterns.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1341" data-end="1527" class="">
<p data-start="1343" data-end="1361" class=""><strong data-start="1343" data-end="1360">Subcomponents</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start="1364" data-end="1527">
<li data-start="1364" data-end="1432" class="">
<p data-start="1366" data-end="1432" class=""><em data-start="1366" data-end="1384">Worldline Mapper</em>: Projects agent trajectories onto bitmap tiles.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1435" data-end="1527" class="">
<p data-start="1437" data-end="1527" class=""><em data-start="1437" data-end="1465">Oscillation Embedding Unit</em>: Encodes standing-wave dynamics, micromovements, or gestures.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="1528" data-end="1584" class="">
<p data-start="1530" data-end="1584" class=""><strong data-start="1530" data-end="1540">Output</strong>: Spatiotemporally encoded texture overlays.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1586" data-end="1589" class="">
<h3 data-start="1591" data-end="1626" class=""><strong data-start="1595" data-end="1626">4. Annotated Noise Injector</strong></h3>
<ul data-start="1627" data-end="2056">
<li data-start="1627" data-end="1742" class="">
<p data-start="1629" data-end="1742" class=""><strong data-start="1629" data-end="1641">Function</strong>: Embeds symbolic, narrative, or categorical metadata into the visual substrate via structured noise.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1743" data-end="1994" class="">
<p data-start="1745" data-end="1763" class=""><strong data-start="1745" data-end="1762">Subcomponents</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start="1766" data-end="1994">
<li data-start="1766" data-end="1876" class="">
<p data-start="1768" data-end="1876" class=""><em data-start="1768" data-end="1793">Steganographic Embedder</em>: Inserts imperceptible signals representing tags, ontologies, or temporal anchors.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1879" data-end="1994" class="">
<p data-start="1881" data-end="1994" class=""><em data-start="1881" data-end="1895">Noise Shaper</em>: Modulates noise fields to avoid aliasing and preserve coherence during compression or generation.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="1995" data-end="2056" class="">
<p data-start="1997" data-end="2056" class=""><strong data-start="1997" data-end="2007">Output</strong>: Embedded bitmaps with latent semantic carriers.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="2058" data-end="2061" class="">
<h3 data-start="2063" data-end="2101" class=""><strong data-start="2067" data-end="2101">5. Trajectory Buffer &amp; Indexer</strong></h3>
<ul data-start="2102" data-end="2470">
