<p data-start="2104" data-end="2205" class=""><strong data-start="2104" data-end="2116">Function</strong>: Stores and retrieves motion histories and predictive intent fields per actor or object.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2206" data-end="2397" class="">
<p data-start="2208" data-end="2226" class=""><strong data-start="2208" data-end="2225">Subcomponents</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start="2229" data-end="2397">
<li data-start="2229" data-end="2305" class="">
<p data-start="2231" data-end="2305" class=""><em data-start="2231" data-end="2251">Memory Ring Buffer</em>: Captures past k-frames for recursive reconstruction.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2308" data-end="2397" class="">
<p data-start="2310" data-end="2397" class=""><em data-start="2310" data-end="2334">Intent Field Estimator</em>: Predicts likely motion paths based on agent type and context.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="2398" data-end="2470" class="">
<p data-start="2400" data-end="2470" class=""><strong data-start="2400" data-end="2410">Output</strong>: Indexed trajectory libraries for generative extrapolation.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="2472" data-end="2475" class="">
<h3 data-start="2477" data-end="2513" class=""><strong data-start="2481" data-end="2513">6. Semantic Holography Layer</strong></h3>
<ul data-start="2514" data-end="2861">
<li data-start="2514" data-end="2601" class="">
<p data-start="2516" data-end="2601" class=""><strong data-start="2516" data-end="2528">Function</strong>: Enables multiscale scene reconstruction from partial or occluded views.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2602" data-end="2773" class="">
<p data-start="2604" data-end="2622" class=""><strong data-start="2604" data-end="2621">Subcomponents</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start="2625" data-end="2773">
<li data-start="2625" data-end="2699" class="">
<p data-start="2627" data-end="2699" class=""><em data-start="2627" data-end="2654">Redundant Encoding Matrix</em>: Distributes key semantic cues across tiles.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2702" data-end="2773" class="">
<p data-start="2704" data-end="2773" class=""><em data-start="2704" data-end="2730">Holographic Interpolator</em>: Uses local-global inference to fill gaps.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="2774" data-end="2861" class="">
<p data-start="2776" data-end="2861" class=""><strong data-start="2776" data-end="2786">Output</strong>: Resilient scene encodings that degrade gracefully under lossy conditions.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="2863" data-end="2866" class="">
<h3 data-start="2868" data-end="2909" class=""><strong data-start="2872" data-end="2909">7. Diffusion-Guided Reconstructor</strong></h3>
<ul data-start="2910" data-end="3315">
<li data-start="2910" data-end="3023" class="">
<p data-start="2912" data-end="3023" class=""><strong data-start="2912" data-end="2924">Function</strong>: Uses trained diffusion models to reconstruct full-resolution scenes from aura and tile encodings.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3024" data-end="3217" class="">
<p data-start="3026" data-end="3044" class=""><strong data-start="3026" data-end="3043">Subcomponents</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start="3047" data-end="3217">
<li data-start="3047" data-end="3122" class="">
<p data-start="3049" data-end="3122" class=""><em data-start="3049" data-end="3070">Denoising Scheduler</em>: Guides temporal unrolling of the scene generation.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3125" data-end="3217" class="">
<p data-start="3127" data-end="3217" class=""><em data-start="3127" data-end="3153">Aura-to-Pixel Translator</em>: Maps latent aura fields back into RGB/semantic output domains.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="3218" data-end="3315" class="">
<p data-start="3220" data-end="3315" class=""><strong data-start="3220" data-end="3230">Output</strong>: Generative reconstructions consistent with underlying physics and narrative states.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="3317" data-end="3320" class="">
<h3 data-start="3322" data-end="3365" class=""><strong data-start="3326" data-end="3365">8. Modular Metadata Interface (MMI)</strong></h3>
<ul data-start="3366" data-end="3642">
<li data-start="3366" data-end="3462" class="">
<p data-start="3368" data-end="3462" class=""><strong data-start="3368" data-end="3380">Function</strong>: Interfaces with external systems (e.g., symbolic reasoners, simulation engines).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3463" data-end="3642" class="">
<p data-start="3465" data-end="3483" class=""><strong data-start="3465" data-end="3482">Subcomponents</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start="3486" data-end="3642">
<li data-start="3486" data-end="3553" class="">
<p data-start="3488" data-end="3553" class=""><em data-start="3488" data-end="3505">Ontology Bridge</em>: Aligns aura annotations with symbolic schemas.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3556" data-end="3642" class="">
<p data-start="3558" data-end="3642" class=""><em data-start="3558" data-end="3571">Control API</em>: Allows dynamic updates of tiling, aura intensity, or narrative focus.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
