96" class="">... misalignment as seen in fractured networks. This categorical architecture enables <strong data-start="86" data-end="113">cross-modal consistency</strong>, allowing symbolic reasoning systems to inherit physical plausibility constraints.</p>
<hr data-start="198" data-end="201" class="">
<h3 data-start="203" data-end="257" class="">3. <strong data-start="210" data-end="257">Oscillatory Dynamics and Worldline Encoding</strong></h3>
<p data-start="259" data-end="364" class="">TARTAN advances representational learning by <strong data-start="304" data-end="337">embedding microdynamic traces</strong> directly into pixel space:</p>
<ul data-start="366" data-end="932">
<li data-start="366" data-end="569" class="">
<p data-start="368" data-end="569" class=""><strong data-start="368" data-end="393">Oscillatory Semantics</strong>: Inspired by <em data-start="407" data-end="429">Memetic Proxy Theory</em>, agents are modeled as oscillatory linkages whose biomechanical rhythms encode affective and cognitive states (e.g., urgency, curiosity).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="570" data-end="752" class="">
<p data-start="572" data-end="752" class=""><strong data-start="572" data-end="597">Worldline Projections</strong>: Trajectory-aware pixel stretching embeds agent motion as extended curves across frames, functioning as <strong data-start="702" data-end="720">causal beacons</strong> in generative reconstruction.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="753" data-end="932" class="">
<p data-start="755" data-end="932" class=""><strong data-start="755" data-end="772">Aura Emitters</strong>: Each dynamic object is surrounded by a <strong data-start="813" data-end="836">Gaussian aura field</strong>, continuously broadcasting parameters like entropy, curvature, and intent [Context #13, #20].</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="934" data-end="1111" class="">These innovations circumvent FER-style entanglement by separating agency, motion, and identity in the embedding space via <strong data-start="1056" data-end="1080">explicit scaffolding</strong>, not emergent feature binding.</p>
<hr data-start="1113" data-end="1116" class="">
<h3 data-start="1118" data-end="1165" class="">4. <strong data-start="1125" data-end="1165">Contrasting Compression Philosophies</strong></h3>
<div class="_tableContainer_16hzy_1"><div tabindex="-1" class="_tableWrapper_16hzy_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse"><table data-start="1167" data-end="1648" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="1167" data-end="1260"><tr data-start="1167" data-end="1260"><th data-start="1167" data-end="1194" data-col-size="sm">Aspect</th><th data-start="1194" data-end="1226" data-col-size="sm">FER</th><th data-start="1226" data-end="1260" data-col-size="md">TARTAN</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="1356" data-end="1648"><tr data-start="1356" data-end="1449"><td data-start="1356" data-end="1383" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="1358" data-end="1382">Compression Strategy</strong></td><td data-start="1383" data-end="1415" data-col-size="sm">Post-hoc, learned redundancy</td><td data-start="1415" data-end="1449" data-col-size="md">Pre-specified, semantic tiling</td></tr><tr data-start="1450" data-end="1543"><td data-start="1450" data-end="1477" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="1452" data-end="1468">Failure Mode</strong></td><td data-start="1477" data-end="1509" data-col-size="sm">Spaghetti entanglement</td><td data-start="1509" data-end="1543" data-col-size="md">Overconstrained tiling</td></tr><tr data-start="1544" data-end="1648"><td data-start="1544" data-end="1571" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="1546" data-end="1569">Correction Approach</strong></td><td data-start="1571" data-end="1603" data-col-size="sm">Diagnostic probes, UFR goals</td><td data-start="1603" data-end="1648" data-col-size="md">Functorial correction, holographic infill</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sticky end-(--thread-content-margin) h-0 self-end select-none"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end" style="height: 32.7031px;"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="bg-token-bg-primary hover:bg-token-bg-tertiary text-token-text-secondary my-1 rounded-sm p-1 transition-opacity group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:pointer-events-none group-[:not(:h