õCDM model and its ‚Äúexpanding universe‚Äù obsession. RSVP says, ‚ÄúScrew that,‚Äù and proposes a static universe where redshift, gravity, and cosmic structure emerge from a structured, pulsating plenum that‚Äôs more alive than your average astrophysicist‚Äôs coffee addiction. I‚Äôm going to break this down in detail, weaving in the core concepts, math, observational predictions, and the spicy philosophical edge that makes RSVP a cosmic game-changer. No fluff, just the good stuff‚Äîmath-heavy, clear, and savage where it needs to be.

