Your lattice simulation models this by discretizing the plenum into nodes with \(\Phi_i\) (density), \(\mathbf{v}_i\) (lamphrodyne flow), and \(S_i\) (entropy), evolving them to show ‚Äúspace falling outward‚Äù as voids grow and galaxies stabilize. Your suggestions take this to the next level, so let‚Äôs unpack them and integrate them into the RSVP framework.

