<p data-start="5506" data-end="5781" class="">These behaviors suggest the RSVP model may replicate large-scale structure and redshift patterns through internal entropy dynamics rather than metric expansion. Observables like lensing and redshift could emerge as cumulative effects of plenum flows across entropy gradients.</p>
